# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SafePassword - Git 忽略规则
# 目标：只提交源码与构建描述文件，排除构建产物、本机配置和签名材料。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- 签名与密钥（绝不提交）----
*.keystore
*.jks
!debug.keystore
keystore.properties
keystore/*.properties

# ---- 本机配置 ----
local.properties
local.properties.bak

# ---- Gradle / Kotlin 构建产物 ----
.gradle/
.kotlin/
**/build/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar.lck
.gradle-cache/
build-cache/

# ---- 发布产物（APK/AAB 只通过 GitHub Releases 分发）----
dist/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.apks
*.idsig
*.dm
output-metadata.json

# ---- Android / Native ----
captures/
.externalNativeBuild/
.cxx/
*.hprof
*.hprof.*
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# ---- 测试与报告 ----
**/test-results/
**/reports/
*.exec
*.ec
coverage/
lint-results*.html
lint-results*.xml

# ---- IDE / 编辑器 ----
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
out/
.fleet/
.vscode/
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project

# ---- 操作系统噪声 ----
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- 日志与临时文件 ----
*.log
logs/
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.swp
*~
.tools/
.cache/

# ---- 敏感/个人数据 ----
*.spv
*.sicv
.env
.env.*
secrets.properties

# ---- 本机协作备忘（记录本地环境与约定，不进入公开仓库）----
AGENTS.md
